# 📩 Responsive Contact Form

A clean, modern, and responsive **Contact Form UI** built with pure **HTML and CSS**.  
This project is simple, lightweight, and easy to customize for business websites, portfolios, landing pages, and personal projects.

## 🔗 Live Project

- **GitHub Repository:** https://github.com/davnasir/contarct-From
- **HTML File:** https://github.com/davnasir/contarct-From/blob/main/contactfrom.html

## ✨ Features

- 📱 Fully responsive design
- 🎨 Modern and clean UI
- 📝 Name, email, subject, and message fields
- 🔘 Modern submit button
- 💻 Pure HTML & CSS
- ⚡ Lightweight and fast
- 🧩 Easy to customize
- 🌐 Suitable for business, portfolio, agency, and landing pages

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
contarct-From/
│
└── contactfrom.html
```

## 🚀 How to Use

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/davnasir/contarct-From.git
```

### 2. Open the project

Open `contactfrom.html` in your preferred browser.

### 3. Customize

You can easily change:

- Form labels
- Placeholder text
- Colors
- Typography
- Spacing
- Button styles
- Form layout

## 📋 Form Fields

The current form includes:

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| Your Name | Text |
| Email Address | Email |
| Subject | Text |
| Message | Textarea |

## ⚠️ Important Note

This repository currently provides the **frontend contact form UI**. The form does not include a backend email-sending system by itself.

To receive submitted messages, connect the form to a backend or a form-handling service.

## 📸 Preview

You can open the HTML file directly in a browser to preview the contact form.

## 🎯 Use Cases

This contact form can be used for:

- Business websites
- Personal portfolios
- Agency websites
- Landing pages
- Startup websites
- Service websites
- Contact sections

